        "поле": "wrong_photos",
        "що": "item outside outfit",
        "сирий": "{\"version\":\"1\",\"text\":\"For your office day I built this around the dress you asked for. I kept it simple: a plain fine-knit dress, a black coat over it, burgundy leather pumps and a burgundy scarf, with small gold earrings. The black coat and the dress form a quiet base, and the burgundy shoes and scarf are the one accent, repeated top and bottom so it reads as a decision. The dress is matte, the shoes have a soft sheen, and the earrings add a small gold note. The look stays at one level of formality, tidy for work without being stiff. It's autumn, so the coat is a sensible layer.\",\"how_to_wear\":[\"Wear the dress as the base and the coat open or belted over it.\",\"Put the scarf around your neck, tucked inside the coat's lapels, so the burgundy sits near your face and links to the shoes. How big the scarf is isn't known, so adjust the fold or knot to whatever it gives you.\",\"Finish with the leather pumps and the gold earrings.\"],\"wrong_photos\":[\"#867·03: the photo shows a light blue ribbed sleeveless dress, but the card lists it as black, so the photo and the card don't match.\"],\"about_items\":[{\"n\":\"#867·03\",\"text\":\"A straight-cut dress in fine ribbed knit with a matte finish. It is the base of the outfit and fits the dress you wanted for work. The coat and scarf sit over it without competing.\"},{\"n\":\"#106·05\",\"text\":\"A black coat that falls to the hip. It is a smart outer layer for the office and sets a dark frame for the burgundy accents. It suits autumn as a layer.\"},{\"n\":\"#567·06\",\"text\":\"Burgundy leather pumps with a soft sheen. They keep the look at a work-appropriate level of formality, and their colour is picked up by the scarf.\"},{\"n\":\"#102·10\",\"text\":\"A burgundy scarf that repeats the colour of the shoes and brings it up to your face. Wear it at the neck inside the coat. Its size is not given, so the way you tie it is up to you.\"},{\"n\":\"#13·12\",\"text\":\"Small gold earrings. They add a quiet warm detail near the face and don't compete with the scarf.\"}]}",
